# seo.milkmoonstudio.com -> scan.milkmoonstudio.com/checklist/ (Bot Appétit redesign R14, decision D2, 2026-10-05).
# The checklist now lives at https://scan.milkmoonstudio.com/checklist/ with the SAME item and phase ids, so an old
# link's #fragment lands on the same item: the browser carries it across a redirect whose Location has none
# (RFC 9110 §10.2.2).
#
# Every line says 301: the default is 302. No splat on purpose — "/*" would also redirect robots.txt and the
# sitemaps, which must keep serving so crawlers can still see this move. Keep this for at least a year, and keep
# src/ intact: rolling back is a revert of this file (Bot Appétit docs/design-brief/12-seo-checklist-merge.md §4.5).
/              https://scan.milkmoonstudio.com/checklist/   301
/index.html    https://scan.milkmoonstudio.com/checklist/   301
/og-image.png  https://scan.milkmoonstudio.com/og-image.png 301
